{"id":"68d8a94406ea9586","group":"89","path":"89/89-ex-nested-box-edge-extension.md","title":"Adding Edges Can Make a Nested Box True","display":"ex-nested-box-edge-extension — Adding Edges Can Make a Nested Box True","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-ex-nested-box-edge-extension","aliases":["89-ex-nested-box-edge-extension"],"display":"ex-nested-box-edge-extension — Adding Edges Can Make a Nested Box True","depends_on":["[[89-df-relation-extension]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-ex-nested-box-edge-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-ex-nested-box-edge-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-nested-box-edge-extension — Adding Edges Can Make a Nested Box True"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3771cb3ddfd32097\" href=\"?note=3771cb3ddfd32097\" title=\"89-df-relation-extension\">89-df-relation-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=\\{0,1,2\\}\">\\(W=\\{0,1,2\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=\\{(0,1)\\}\">\\(R=\\{(0,1)\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R&#39;=R\\cup\\{(1,2)\\}\">\\(R&#39;=R\\cup\\{(1,2)\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,R,V)\">\\(M=(W,R,V)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M&#39;=(W,R&#39;,V)\">\\(M&#39;=(W,R&#39;,V)\\)</span> 使用同一任意命题赋值，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelExt}\">\\(\\mathrm{RelExt}\\)</span> 为同载体扩张。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\neg\\Box\\bot\">\\(A=\\neg\\Box\\bot\\)</span> 为含模态算子的内容公式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}nested\\text{-}box\\text{-}edge\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RelExt}((W,R),(W,R&#39;))\\land\nM,0\\not\\models\\Box A\\land M&#39;,0\\models\\Box A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}nested\\text{-}box\\text{-}edge\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RelExt}((W,R),(W,R&#39;))\\land\nM,0\\not\\models\\Box A\\land M&#39;,0\\models\\Box A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>见证计算：在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 中，1 无后继，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\bot\">\\(\\Box\\bot\\)</span> 真，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 假，根的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\">\\(\\Box A\\)</span> 假；在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M&#39;\">\\(M&#39;\\)</span> 中，1 有后继 2，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\bot\">\\(\\Box\\bot\\)</span> 假，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 真，根的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\">\\(\\Box A\\)</span> 真。\n这个例子来自本次按原书第 4 章递归语义进行的边界检查，不是书中原编号例子。它说明“加边使盒更难成立”的直觉须把盒内内容的真值固定；嵌套公式会改变后继处真值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-relation-extension","status":"resolved","id":"3771cb3ddfd32097","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-relation-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"W=\\{0,1,2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R=\\{(0,1)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R'=R\\cup\\{(1,2)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"M=(W,R,V)","display":false},{"tex":"M'=(W,R',V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelExt}","display":false},{"tex":"A=\\neg\\Box\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}nested\\text{-}box\\text{-}edge\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RelExt}((W,R),(W,R'))\\land\nM,0\\not\\models\\Box A\\land M',0\\models\\Box A.","display":true},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box A","display":false},{"tex":"M'","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box A","display":false}],"bytes":1268,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]] → [[89-df-converse-well-founded]] → [[89-df-gl-frame]] → [[89-prop-gl-characteristic-frame]] → [[89-prop-converse-wf-transitive]] → [[89-ex-nested-box-edge-extension]]"}],"outgoing":["3771cb3ddfd32097","9f00301866fbd6f0"]}